'''Metal Snache''' (メタルにょろ ''Metaru Nyoro'', '''Metal Nyoro''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Snache]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]].

