==Enemy==
This enemy does not pose much of a threat alone, however it is extremely annoying when supporting other enemies. It screws with your single-target [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] and absorbs '''a LOT''' of hits from your other cats, often spawned in groups just like [[Metal Doge]], but with far less DPS.

