==Trivia==
*In the first [[Media:Silver img01 en.jpg|event poster]] for [[Silver Week]], Metal Snache was referred to as "Steel Snache", which was the only name it had until it was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*Unlike other Snache variants, this enemy is actually weak to [[Ototo Corps#Waterblast|water]] thanks to its [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] trait.
*This Metal enemy is not like the others. It looks like it is 100% metal, instead of just having metal body parts like [[Metal Hippoe]].
*It could be a reference to [[wikia:dragonquest:Metal slime|Metal Slime]] from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Quest|Dragon Quest]]'', as both look like semiliquid metal, take 1 damage from most hits while having low HP, and share a pointy tip in the upper part of their head.

